          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Delivery status is an icon, not a word: clock = sending, ✓ = sent, ✓✓ = delivered, same colour and size as the timestamp (16dp), placed after the time at the bubble's end edge (left in RTL). Every icon carries a spoken label (Sent / ارسال شد). Only failure keeps words — red alert + “Not sent · Tap to retry”. Message info screens still spell out Sent and Delivered times.",
