                  "content": "48 × 48 dp minimum touch targets; 8 dp between adjacent controls. Message text 18 sp, supporting text 14–16 sp. Use sp and system font scaling. Long names and content wrap; timelines scroll at runtime. Canvas screens show the full content rather than simulating scrolling.",
