          "content": "Floating, not inline. Sits 16 above the bottom navigation, 20 from the end edge (bottom-left in RTL). Expanded (icon + \"New message\") at the top of the list; collapses to the 56×56 icon-only FAB once the list scrolls, and in landscape / short windows. Hidden while selecting. It may cover part of a row at the top of the list; that is accepted. Replaces the inline New message button on 01, 34, 57, 61.",
